      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DASHING DEREK (7) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by 5.5 lengths (22.13) over 390m at this track. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. WHERE'S MICK (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Cackling Suzie (22.25) in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Leading player again. ZIPPING MARIE (1) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (22.40) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Comes through a solid form race last start. Must be included in calculations. MEPUNGA BROCKIE (6) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
